  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">本專案已停止更新！是否要看看我的新專案？</span><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/reverie-foundry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reverie Foundry - Minecraft 模組包 - CurseForge</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079886/description_8d12ef3f-e85f-4b03-8dfc-ffbe75c496b6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"390\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">⭐暗影覺醒 - 於暗影深淵中甦醒，你能在這危機四伏的世界生存下來嗎？⭐</span></p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">❤️整合包特色</span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">🌑 暗影帷幕下的早期生存？</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">在前期，玩家不僅要面對原版飢餓值的挑戰，還需在飲水、體溫、疾病與更聰明的怪物之間周旋，才能爭取到一席生存空間。食物的營養需要仔細均衡，飲用水的淨化程度也需留意。當暗影籠罩這片土地，裹緊你的皮外套，讓我們繼續前進。當然，某些寶物能減輕惡劣環境帶來的不良影響。</span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">⚔ 高度自訂的成長之路？</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">基於被動技能樹與封神雙系統，玩家可透過附魔、寶石鑲嵌、鍛造等方式逐步提升實力！配合 Truly Modular 與 tetra，獨一無二的自訂武器裝備將由你親手打造！曾經僅能定位要塞的眼睛不再只是簡單的指引，它們能化身為強大的飾品，為你的旅途提供助力！</span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">🚌 永無止境的遠征？</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">當你足夠強大後，仍有許多道路可供選擇。你會利用顫動核心汲取撼地者的魔法威能嗎？你會揮動強力巨鎚鍛造注定被傳頌的傳說武器嗎？抑或只是簡單安頓下來，搭乘飛空艇尋找適合生火做飯的臨時居所？一切由你決定。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079886/description_67f3043b-4d2b-4719-84c4-a72cbf158e0a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"408\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079886/description_c9f901fa-4916-4b80-9432-39c1e6e30d95.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"772\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079886/description_5e17c2a4-1292-400d-bb2f-3331dd70c92f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"339\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079886/description_d647ab5a-aa9d-40d5-a5ec-9ab14c09404c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"394\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079886/description_b66e21dc-eefc-4fb7-8478-eda411401d96.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"431\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079886/description_316ff56b-87b1-44a3-90cc-fb1a122d5469.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"391\"></p>\n</div><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\">🧥 <span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">超過 80 種新生態域、8,000 多項新成就、100 多種全新材質的生物！新增口渴、體溫、疾病與營養元素作為旅途阻礙。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">🧟 怪物經 Enhanced AI 強化，變得更加聰明！不死生物需特殊金屬或法術才能克制！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">🧙 多種魔法學派供你選擇！結合機械動力與魔法，升級墨水並自動化生產魔法材料！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">🪄 多樣化被動技能樹強化自身！各式收藏套組讓旅途永不乏味！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">🔨 基於連動公式的自訂進階合成配方！更多可自訂的新物品！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">💀 更多奇妙頭目等你挑戰！可自訂的遊戲難度！你能擊敗異界之門嗎？（1.6 版本前需開啟作弊）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">🙎‍♂️ 更真實的村民！超過 15 種新村民職業！寶藏商人可能販售某些稀有物品？其職業方塊的稀有度決定等級。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">🔪 使用 Tetra 自訂你的武器！或獲取具特殊屬性的更強力武器！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">🎖️ 享受 40+ 種套裝加成！用寶石為武器附魔獲得更強附魔效果！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">🪞 使用 Truly Modular 模組完全自訂你的盔甲！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">🐈‍⬛ 使用 goety 突破附魔限制！你能否承擔相應代價？</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#169179\">關於此整合包</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">新生態域！新任務！新挑戰！</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">模組數量：<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">295+</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">建議分配記憶體：<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">5.5GB</span> 以上（低於<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">13GB</span>）</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">請勿為此包分配過多記憶體！！！</span></p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">提示：</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">這是我的第一個模組包，我將在後續更新中完善它。如有錯誤請告知，謝謝。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">此整合中部分模組需多執行緒！舊電腦可能難以執行或閃退，但請放心，只要你的電腦不是特別老舊，仍可執行並遊玩無礙。</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">使用資源包：</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pugs-tetra-retexture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pug's Tetra Retexture - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/gui-retextures\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI Retextures - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/gui-retextures-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI Retextures Compatibility - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vixel-evolved-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evolved Pack - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-moves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Moves - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ender-dragon-revamp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender Dragon Revamp - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-waystones-texture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Waystones Texture - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eclectic-trove-legendary-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eclectic Trove (Legendary Tooltips) - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stefans-enchanted-books\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stefan's Enchanted Books - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vn4s-fresh-wither-storm\" rel=\"nofollow\">VN4's Fresh Wither Storm - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/more-mob-variants-fresh-animations-addon/files/4673000\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Mob Variants x Fresh Animations - 檔案 - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chaotix-apotheotic-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chaotix Apotheotic Tweaks - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/elysia-presents-lootr/comments\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elysia Presents: Lootr - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/gobblyns-better-irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobblyn's Better Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/renovated-textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Renovated Textures for Iron's Spells - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/moonsu-better-gui-for-sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Moonsu] Better GUI for Sophisticated Backpacks - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/colourful-containers-modded-compatibility-pack/files/5902841\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colourful Containers: Modded GUI Pack - 檔案 - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/colourful-containers-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colourful Containers GUI - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - Dark mode - Minecraft 資源包 - CurseForge</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div><hr></div>",
